cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EGAnetLab: A jamovi Module for Exploratory Graph Analysis"
message: >
  If you use EGAnetLab in your research, please cite the software using the
  metadata below, and cite EGAnet and the methods it implements as listed in
  docs/Bibliography.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Chacón Chacón"
    given-names: "Arquímedes De León"
    affiliation: "Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7014-7513"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ArchieJamDev/EGAnetLab"
license: "GPL-3.0-only"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-31"
abstract: >
  EGAnetLab is an open-source jamovi module that brings the network
  psychometrics methods of the EGAnet R package to jamovi, pairing every
  result with evidence-based methodological guidance, interpretation and
  educational support.
keywords:
  - jamovi
  - Exploratory Graph Analysis
  - Network Psychometrics
  - Dimensionality
  - EGAnet
  - Open Science
language: en
